/A 1094 0 R
/Alt (Panel A shows a hierarchical dendrogram and a heatmap of sample traits for control and DCM groups. Panel B displays two line graphs: scale independence and mean connectivity as functions of soft threshold power. Panel C presents a cluster dendrogram with corresponding color bars for module assignment below. Panel D illustrates a dendrogram clustering module eigengenes. Panel E is a heatmap matrix of module-trait relationships with quantitative values for control and DCM conditions. Panel F is a scatterplot of gene significance for DCM versus module membership in the brown module with a correlation value annotated.)
